# Senda de Campeones, floor 3 (C9, contract 56), 28 x 22, a cave. The ladder from floor 2 arrives in the SW hall (ladder (3,19), spawn from_2); the boulder (5,17) is pushed east along row 17 into the pit (12,17)
# (7 pushes); that opens the GATE OF ROCKS (13,2) in the exit corridor (the step trigger (13,3)); the exit (13,0) leads to the Meseta Cumbre. The route goes round: the east hall (20..26,12..20), the corridor north (23,9..11) into IGNICONDOR'S
# chamber (22..26,2..8: the legend, L50, `legend=ignicondor`), then west through the connector (20..21,6) into the north hall and the exit corridor. Three trainers.
@map senda_3
@size 28 22
@interior no
@cave yes
@area senda_campeones
@bg 0
@fill rockg
@spawn from_2 4 19 E
@spawn north 13 1 S
@flag ignicondor_gone 912                 # Ignicondor was beaten or caught (the legend NPC's hide flag; Run keeps it)
@flag senda_pit3 908                  # the pit of floor 3 (a boulder filled it)
@flag senda3_open 911                  # the gate of floor 3 opened (set by the step trigger once the pit is filled)
@flag beaten_elite_s3a 921
@flag beaten_karateka_s3b 922
@flag beaten_elite_s3c 923
@encounters grass rate=14
  tuskid 40 44 5
  tuskmash 43 46 15
  cragodile 40 44 10
  echowing 42 46 20
  rockroll 42 46 5
  dashmark 43 46 10
  bouldrum 44 47 25
  kickaroo 42 45 10
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, wild zone): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 8 (8/256 per step).
@open_rate 8
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass area=,. period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=rockg
  ,  tile=rockf
  W  tile=none object=swall
  r  tile=none object=srubble
  _  tile=none
  f  tile=rockg object=torch
  a  tile=rockg object=stalag_a
  b  tile=rockg boulder=yes
  h  tile=rockg hole=senda_pit3
  G  tile=rockg npc=rock_gate id=gate3 face=S solid=yes gate=yes hide_flag=senda3_open text=sd.gate
  t  tile=rockf interact=step script=gate3_check
  L  tile=rockf door=rope_ladder
  n  tile=rockf
  i  item=prime_salve
  j  item=ultra_cristal
  k  item=ward_spray
  l  item=vit_spc
  A  tile=rockg npc=elite_s id=elite_s3a face=NE trainer=elite_s3a range=3 text=tr.elite_s3a.pre after=tr.elite_s3a.after beaten_flag=beaten_elite_s3a
  B  tile=rockg npc=karateka_s id=karateka_s3b face=NW trainer=karateka_s3b range=3 text=tr.karateka_s3b.pre after=tr.karateka_s3b.after beaten_flag=beaten_karateka_s3b
  C  tile=rockg npc=elite_s id=elite_s3c face=NE trainer=elite_s3c range=3 text=tr.elite_s3c.pre after=tr.elite_s3c.after beaten_flag=beaten_elite_s3c
  Z  tile=rockf legend=ignicondor level=50 npc=ignicondor_ow face=SW hide_flag=ignicondor_gone
  c  tile=rockg item=disc_47
  H  tile=rockg hidden=growth_seed   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  ____________Wnr_____________
  ____________W,r______WWWWWW_
  ____________WGr______W.....r
  _______WWWWWWtWWWWWW_W.....r
  _______Wf..........frW..Z..r
  _______W.j..........WW.....r
  _______W...................r
  _______W............rW.....r
  _______W.....C..A...rWf....r
  _______W............r_W.rrr_
  _______W..a.........r_W.r___
  ________rrrrrrrrrrrWWWW.WWW_
  ___________________Wf....cfr
  __WWWWWWWWW________W.......r
  __Wfi.....fr_______W.......r
  __W........r_______W.......r
  __W........WWWWWWWWW.......r
  __W..b......h..........B...r
  __W........rrrrrrrrW.......r
  __WL,,.....r_______W......lr
  __Wa,......r_______W....H.ar
  ___rrrrrrrr_________rrrrrrr_
@warp n -> meseta_cumbre spawn=south
@warp L -> senda_2 spawn=from_3
# The gate of floor 3 (the Senda's switch, Senda de Campeones boulder switches): a boulder pushed onto the pit fills it (flag senda_pit3, engine); the step trigger in front of the gate opens it the moment the hero
# stands there (a wall of rocks that crumbles); the gate's own hide flag keeps it open for good.
@script gate3_check step if senda_pit3
    jf senda3_open done
    sfx door
    npc_hide gate3
    setf senda3_open
  done:
    end
@end
